\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus, keep me near the Cross;
\par There a precious fountain, 
\par Free to all, a healing steam,
\par Flows from Calvary's mountain.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par In the Cross, in the Cross,
\par Be my glory ever;
\par Till my raptured soul shall find
\par Rest beyond the river.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Near the Cross a, trembling soul,
\par Love and mercy found me;
\par There the bright and morning star
\par Sheds its beams around me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par In the Cross, in the Cross,
\par Be my glory ever;
\par Till my raptured soul shall find
\par Rest beyond the river.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Near the Cross: O Lamp of God,
\par Bring its scenes before me;
\par Help me walk from day to day,
\par With its shadow o'er me
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par In the Cross, in the Cross,
\par Be my glory ever;
\par Till my raptured soul shall find
\par Rest beyond the river.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Near the Cross I'll watch and wait,
\par Hoping, trusting ever,
\par Till I reach the golden strand,
\par Just be yond the river.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par In the Cross, in the Cross,
\par Be my glory ever;
\par Till my raptured soul shall find
\par Rest beyond the river.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

